  "description": {
   "en": "A goblin who lived peacefully in the mountains and two women who changed his live forever.\n\nHe had never loved someone so much. and she had never hated someone so much!\nA spirited girl, a mischievous fox, and a cruel, but devoted, goblin.\n\nWhether the relationship between the three is good or bad, one thing is certain. It will only end when someone dies!\n\nA lyrical romance drama that alternates between hilarity and sadness."
  },
